  "job_B21.2.1.2.2_20251003_114544": {
    "chunk_text": "en wunde, betonican wyl on wine, sele drincan. Wi\u00fe \u00feon ilcan genim mugcwyrt ni\u00feewearde & brunewyrt, wyl on buteran. Wi\u00fe lungenadle genim cwican & acrinde & garclifan, gecnuwa tog\u00e6dere, bewylle \u00feonne \u00feriddan Eft, genim brune wyrt & bisceopwyrt, wudu merce, wudu cerfillan, eofor fearn, hind hiolo\u00fee, Wi\u00fe lungenadle, dolhrune & \u00e6fer\u00fee nio\u00feoweard & brune wyrt & reade hofe & reade netlan, awylle Eft, genim r\u00e6dices III sn\u00e6da & brade leaces gelice & spices III, do \u00fe\u00e6t III dagas o\u00fe\u00fee nigon. To spiwdrence, VI corn alwan, XXX lybcorna & \u00fea greatan wyrt nio\u00feowearde, hwerwe hatte, drige Eft, wermod & eolonan, l\u00e6sse, l\u00e6t standan twa niht on ealo\u00fe, drince \u00feonne. Eft, gl\u00e6dene, hofe, fleotwyrt, cnuwa on eala\u00fe & geswet, drince \u00feonne. Gif mon hine brece ofer gemet to spiwanne si\u00fe\u00fean him spiw drenc of sie genim f\u00e6ttes fl\u00e6sces, sele Wece drenc, elene, \u00feone l\u00e6stan d\u00e6l \u00feunges, cammoc, wyl \u00fe\u00e6t on eala\u00fe, sele \u00fe\u00e6t lytlum supan \u00de\u00e6t is hofe, ni\u00feeweard bescrepen & gecnuad & ellen wyrttruman rinde, aw\u00e6sc \u00fea cl\u00e6ne & Drince \u00feonne on morgen & hine wreo wearme & him sl\u00e6p beorge swi\u00fee georne. Lange he m\u00e6g on \u00feam wyrtum",
